{"3400300": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Madora", "steam_appid": 3400300, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3400300/extras/75bb92931a78bf74a60e16d407c63d4f.webp?t=1787951400\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3400300/extras/75bb92931a78bf74a60e16d407c63d4f.poster.avif?t=1787951400\" class=\"bb_img\" width=1138 height=200 /></picture></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Madora is a third person 3D action roguelite built around fast paced combat and dynamic character builds. Master heroes inspired by Brazilian folklore, switch your abilities between active skills and passive effects in the middle of battle, and survive relentless waves of corrupted creatures.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Death is only the beginning of your build. Enter the arena of a ruthless, corrupted world and face long-forgotten entities. Every encounter demands quick reflexes, precise dodges, and constant mastery of your evolving abilities.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3400300/extras/c276c0e7b93909e1262de37da236860c.poster.avif?t=1787951400\" width=1138 height=640 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3400300/extras/c276c0e7b93909e1262de37da236860c.webm?t=1787951400\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3400300/extras/c276c0e7b93909e1262de37da236860c.mp4?t=1787951400\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3400300/extras/42c2b5856361d3b7eeedbeec3e978129.webp?t=1787951400\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3400300/extras/42c2b5856361d3b7eeedbeec3e978129.poster.avif?t=1787951400\" class=\"bb_img\" width=1138 height=200 /></picture></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Forget static builds. The heart of Madora's gameplay is its dynamic skill system. Choose which skills to upgrade mid-run, creating effects that combine in a multitude of unique ways. Unleash devastating combos, shift your strategy during boss fights, and shape your playstyle in real time..</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3400300/extras/d0578236a09ed9296163a2331746d5c5.poster.avif?t=1787951400\" width=1138 height=640 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3400300/extras/d0578236a09ed9296163a2331746d5c5.webm?t=1787951400\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3400300/extras/d0578236a09ed9296163a2331746d5c5.mp4?t=1787951400\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3400300/extras/6d9799e4254479a9f2b959fdf2e604cf.webp?t=1787951400\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3400300/extras/6d9799e4254479a9f2b959fdf2e604cf.poster.avif?t=1787951400\" class=\"bb_img\" width=1138 height=200 /></picture></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play as heroes with completely distinct combat styles. Master Korá's agility, Perê's speed, or Rhara's overwhelming strength. Each character brings unique mechanics and a deep connection to the world's lore.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Battle terrifying creatures inspired by Brazilian folklore, from towering monstrosities to forest spirits twisted by corruption.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3400300/extras/606cb70ab5999d9501ad9ab74e1b8cde.poster.avif?t=1787951400\" width=1138 height=640 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3400300/extras/606cb70ab5999d9501ad9ab74e1b8cde.webm?t=1787951400\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3400300/extras/606cb70ab5999d9501ad9ab74e1b8cde.mp4?t=1787951400\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3400300/extras/bcd4f85a3a5a19a72c968cea040a4d37.webp?t=1787951400\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3400300/extras/bcd4f85a3a5a19a72c968cea040a4d37.poster.avif?t=1787951400\" class=\"bb_img\" width=1138 height=200 /></picture></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you enjoy the frantic combat of Risk of Rain 2, the build variety of Hades, or the unforgiving challenge of Dead Cells, Madora delivers a skill driven action experience with striking visuals, an atmospheric soundtrack, and combat that rewards mastery.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3400300/extras/35c6e839dab06ad2a03986ca61ef8960.poster.avif?t=1787951400\" width=1138 height=640 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3400300/extras/35c6e839dab06ad2a03986ca61ef8960.webm?t=1787951400\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3400300/extras/35c6e839dab06ad2a03986ca61ef8960.mp4?t=1787951400\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>", "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3400300/extras/75bb92931a78bf74a60e16d407c63d4f.webp?t=1787951400\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3400300/extras/75bb92931a78bf74a60e16d407c63d4f.poster.avif?t=1787951400\" class=\"bb_img\" width=1138 height=200 /></picture></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Madora is a third person 3D action roguelite built around fast paced combat and dynamic character builds. Master heroes inspired by Brazilian folklore, switch your abilities between active skills and passive effects in the middle of battle, and survive relentless waves of corrupted creatures.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Death is only the beginning of your build. Enter the arena of a ruthless, corrupted world and face long-forgotten entities. Every encounter demands quick reflexes, precise dodges, and constant mastery of your evolving abilities.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3400300/extras/c276c0e7b93909e1262de37da236860c.poster.avif?t=1787951400\" width=1138 height=640 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3400300/extras/c276c0e7b93909e1262de37da236860c.webm?t=1787951400\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3400300/extras/c276c0e7b93909e1262de37da236860c.mp4?t=1787951400\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3400300/extras/42c2b5856361d3b7eeedbeec3e978129.webp?t=1787951400\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3400300/extras/42c2b5856361d3b7eeedbeec3e978129.poster.avif?t=1787951400\" class=\"bb_img\" width=1138 height=200 /></picture></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Forget static builds. The heart of Madora's gameplay is its dynamic skill system. Choose which skills to upgrade mid-run, creating effects that combine in a multitude of unique ways. Unleash devastating combos, shift your strategy during boss fights, and shape your playstyle in real time..</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3400300/extras/d0578236a09ed9296163a2331746d5c5.poster.avif?t=1787951400\" width=1138 height=640 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3400300/extras/d0578236a09ed9296163a2331746d5c5.webm?t=1787951400\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3400300/extras/d0578236a09ed9296163a2331746d5c5.mp4?t=1787951400\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3400300/extras/6d9799e4254479a9f2b959fdf2e604cf.webp?t=1787951400\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3400300/extras/6d9799e4254479a9f2b959fdf2e604cf.poster.avif?t=1787951400\" class=\"bb_img\" width=1138 height=200 /></picture></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play as heroes with completely distinct combat styles. Master Korá's agility, Perê's speed, or Rhara's overwhelming strength. Each character brings unique mechanics and a deep connection to the world's lore.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Battle terrifying creatures inspired by Brazilian folklore, from towering monstrosities to forest spirits twisted by corruption.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3400300/extras/606cb70ab5999d9501ad9ab74e1b8cde.poster.avif?t=1787951400\" width=1138 height=640 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3400300/extras/606cb70ab5999d9501ad9ab74e1b8cde.webm?t=1787951400\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3400300/extras/606cb70ab5999d9501ad9ab74e1b8cde.mp4?t=1787951400\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3400300/extras/bcd4f85a3a5a19a72c968cea040a4d37.webp?t=1787951400\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3400300/extras/bcd4f85a3a5a19a72c968cea040a4d37.poster.avif?t=1787951400\" class=\"bb_img\" width=1138 height=200 /></picture></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you enjoy the frantic combat of Risk of Rain 2, the build variety of Hades, or the unforgiving challenge of Dead Cells, Madora delivers a skill driven action experience with striking visuals, an atmospheric soundtrack, and combat that rewards mastery.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3400300/extras/35c6e839dab06ad2a03986ca61ef8960.poster.avif?t=1787951400